<title>SPAIN: Spain 1-yr T-bill yield falls to 5.052 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain 1-yr T-bill yield falls to 5.052 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at today's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>ISSUE	Yield    Pvs     Price     Pvs	Bid    Allocated</p>
<p>1-year     5.052    5.579   95.14    94.66   586.518  380.071</p>
</text>
